### 创建单个章节
POST http://localhost:8080/chapter/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": 1,
  "title": "第一章 Java基础",
  "description": "介绍Java语言的基本概念和语法"
}

### 批量创建课程章节
POST http://localhost:8080/chapter/batch-create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": 1,
  "chapters": [
    {
      "title": "第二章 面向对象编程",
      "description": "深入理解面向对象编程的概念"
    },
    {
      "title": "第三章 集合框架",
      "description": "学习Java集合框架的使用"
    },
    {
      "title": "第四章 异常处理",
      "description": "掌握Java异常处理机制"
    }
  ]
}

### 根据ID获取章节详情
GET http://localhost:8080/chapter/1

### 根据课程ID获取章节列表
GET http://localhost:8080/chapter/list?courseId=1

### 更新章节信息
POST http://localhost:8080/chapter/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "courseId": 1,
  "title": "第一章 Java入门",
  "description": "介绍Java语言的基本概念、环境搭建和基础语法"
}

### 删除章节
DELETE http://localhost:8080/chapter/1

### 根据课程ID删除章节
DELETE http://localhost:8080/chapter/by-course?courseId=1